WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.212 --> 00:00:02.454
- My mind, is like, thinking way more

00:00:02.454 --> 00:00:03.885
faster than I am. (giggling)

00:00:03.885 --> 00:00:07.066
- Are you are just talking
all kinds of strange shit?

00:00:07.066 --> 00:00:11.230
(electronic music)

00:00:11.230 --> 00:00:15.401
- Did I think that I would
actually be sitting here one day

00:00:15.401 --> 00:00:18.140
with one of my kids
getting ready to get high?

00:00:18.140 --> 00:00:19.920
No!
- I did.

00:00:19.920 --> 00:00:22.583
- Pot wasn't really something I did a lot.

00:00:22.583 --> 00:00:24.472
That really wasn't my
thing when I was younger.

00:00:24.472 --> 00:00:28.374
On occasion here and there,
and then I got cancer.

00:00:28.374 --> 00:00:29.596
Started getting treatments that really

00:00:29.596 --> 00:00:30.766
made me sick to my stomach.

00:00:30.766 --> 00:00:34.770
So I started getting it
directly from the doctor.

00:00:34.770 --> 00:00:36.443
And now they have me on cannabis oil

00:00:36.443 --> 00:00:38.242
so that's kinda fun too.

00:00:38.242 --> 00:00:41.425
I was kinda surprised when
I found out you smoked pot.

00:00:41.425 --> 00:00:42.660
Thought it wasn't your thing?

00:00:42.660 --> 00:00:46.523
- No it wasn't for a long
time but then, one day it was.

00:00:46.523 --> 00:00:48.372
It gives me a lot less,

00:00:48.372 --> 00:00:50.878
a lot less problems than, like,
I dunno, getting hammered.

00:00:50.878 --> 00:00:52.317
The worst I do when I am high is I'm like,

00:00:52.317 --> 00:00:54.954
"Alright, let's watch something on TV."

00:00:54.954 --> 00:00:57.467
(funk music)

00:00:57.467 --> 00:01:00.068
- I gotta say, it is
kinda weird to be loading

00:01:00.068 --> 00:01:02.007
a bong for my mom.

00:01:02.007 --> 00:01:03.078
- (giggles)

00:01:03.078 --> 00:01:04.111
Are you gonna burn my eyebrows?

00:01:04.111 --> 00:01:06.922
- No, I'm not gonna burn your eyebrows.

00:01:06.922 --> 00:01:08.651
Start inhaling.

00:01:10.722 --> 00:01:12.012
- [Illie] Wee!

00:01:13.115 --> 00:01:14.925
- Maybe you could do a little bit more.

00:01:14.925 --> 00:01:15.727
- [Illie] Why?

00:01:15.727 --> 00:01:18.199
- Metabolism does come into play here.

00:01:18.199 --> 00:01:19.243
- What do you mean?

00:01:19.243 --> 00:01:21.705
- Like slow metabolism, fast metabolism.

00:01:21.705 --> 00:01:22.622
- Mine's slow.

00:01:22.622 --> 00:01:25.025
- Right, so it's gonna take a
little bit longer to hit ya.

00:01:25.025 --> 00:01:26.674
- Oh.

00:01:27.824 --> 00:01:28.539
(giggling)

00:01:28.539 --> 00:01:31.768
- What are you doing?

00:01:34.748 --> 00:01:36.637
Jesus!

00:01:36.637 --> 00:01:39.104
- I just bounced 20 feet ahead of you.

00:01:39.104 --> 00:01:41.928
(both giggling)

00:01:41.928 --> 00:01:44.992
Now I'm gonna be like RoboCop.

00:01:44.992 --> 00:01:46.914
- This is so fucking weird.

00:01:46.914 --> 00:01:48.817
- You're just such a good boy!

00:01:48.817 --> 00:01:50.419
Just so you know, back in the 90's,

00:01:50.419 --> 00:01:52.937
he actually created the first flip phone.

00:01:52.937 --> 00:01:53.913
- No, I did not.

00:01:53.913 --> 00:01:55.109
- You did.

00:01:55.109 --> 00:01:56.049
- No, I didn't!

00:01:56.049 --> 00:01:57.617
- You created that first design.

00:01:57.617 --> 00:01:58.754
- It was paper.

00:01:58.754 --> 00:01:59.716
- I know.

00:01:59.716 --> 00:02:00.638
- (giggling)

00:02:00.638 --> 00:02:01.427
- I know.

00:02:01.427 --> 00:02:03.531
But you had the vision.

00:02:03.531 --> 00:02:07.017
(both laughing)

00:02:08.741 --> 00:02:10.314
- What?

00:02:11.783 --> 00:02:13.199
- Oh, hell yeah.

00:02:13.199 --> 00:02:14.767
As far as I'm concerned,
I can sit here for the

00:02:14.767 --> 00:02:16.160
next few hours and just kick back

00:02:16.160 --> 00:02:17.727
